  <section class="stat-row"><span>当前模型<strong id="stat-model">载入中</strong></span><span>可见三角形<strong id="stat-tris">—</strong></span><span>模型单位<strong>未标定的源坐标</strong></span><span>安装参考映射<strong id="stat-pairs">0</strong></span><span>可见裁片覆盖<strong id="stat-coverage">—</strong></span></section>
